Hi all,

This is next version of nf_conntrack which generalizes Layer 3 protocol
dependent part in ip_conntrack. FTP, TCP, UDP, ICMP, ICMPv6 over IPv4/IPv6
connections can be tracked.

In this version, optimazation for allocating conntrack are applyed.
The smaller memory spaces are allocated in the case that helper features is
not needed.

Regards,

